---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/Navbar.astro";

const title = "Off-Road vs Semi Off-Road Caravans: Which One is Right for You?";
const description = "Understanding the difference between off-road and semi off-road caravans can help you avoid costly mistakes and ensure your caravan matches your adventure plans.";
---

<Layout title={`${title} | Hike RV Blogs`} description={description}>
    <Navbar />

    <main class="w-full bg-white text-black min-h-screen relative font-sans">
        
        <!-- Luxury Article Header -->
        <header class="relative w-full bg-black pt-40 pb-20 md:pt-56 md:pb-32 px-6 md:px-14 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black via-black/90 to-[#111] z-0"></div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-40 bg-[url('/blogs/off-road-vs-semi.png')] bg-cover bg-center mix-blend-overlay z-0"></div>

            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto relative z-10">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8 animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 200ms; animation-fill-mode: both;">
                   <a href="/blogs" class="text-[#E50000] text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] hover:text-white transition-colors">Blogs</a>
                   <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/20"></div>
                   <span class="text-white/40 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em]">Comparison Guide</span>
                </div>

                <h1 class="text-white text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.9] mb-12 animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 400ms; animation-fill-mode: both;">
                    Off-Road vs <br/>
                    <span class="text-[#E50000]">Semi Off-Road.</span>
                </h1>

                <div class="flex items-center gap-8 animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 600ms; animation-fill-mode: both;">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#E50000] flex items-center justify-center text-white font-black text-[10px]">RV</div>
                        <span class="text-white font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px]">Hike RV Team</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-px h-6 bg-white/10"></div>
                    <span class="text-white/40 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest">8 Min Read</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- Article Content -->
        <article class="relative z-10 w-full py-20 bg-white">
            <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10">
                
                <div class="prose prose-lg prose-black max-w-none">
                    <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium leading-relaxed text-black/70 mb-12 italic border-l-4 border-[#E50000] pl-8">
                        Australia offers some of the most incredible road trips in the world — from coastal drives and national parks to rugged outback tracks. For travellers looking to explore these diverse landscapes, choosing the right caravan is essential.
                    </p>

                    <p class="mb-8">One of the most common questions among caravan buyers is: <strong>Should I buy an Off-Road Caravan or a Semi Off-Road Caravan?</strong></p>
                    
                    <p class="mb-12">While both types are designed for touring, they are built for very different conditions and travel styles. Understanding the difference can help you avoid costly mistakes and ensure your caravan matches your adventure plans.</p>

                    <div class="w-full my-16 rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-black/5">
                        <img src="/blogs/off-road-vs-semi.png" alt="Off-Road Performance" class="w-full h-auto" />
                        <div class="p-6 bg-[#f9f9f9] text-center text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-black/30">Hike RV Extreme Terrain Engineering</div>
                    </div>

                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter text-black mt-20 mb-8">What Is an Off-Road Caravan?</h2>
                    <p class="mb-8">An off-road caravan is specifically engineered to handle extreme terrain and remote travel. These caravans are designed for rugged tracks, corrugated roads, river crossings, and remote outback conditions.</p>
                    <p class="mb-12">They are built with stronger chassis, reinforced suspension systems, and durable materials to withstand constant vibrations and impacts. Travellers who plan to explore places like Cape York, Kimberley, or the Simpson Desert typically choose off-road caravans.</p>

                    <div class="bg-[#f9f9f9] p-8 md:p-12 rounded-[2rem] border border-black/5 mb-16">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#E50000] mb-6">Key Engineering Features</h3>
                        <ul class="space-y-4 list-none p-0">
                            <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="text-black font-black">Heavy-Duty Chassis:</span> Reinforced steel to handle intense terrain without structural damage.</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="text-black font-black">Independent Suspension:</span> Allows each wheel to move separately for better shock absorption and stability.</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="text-black font-black">High Ground Clearance:</span> Prevents damage from rocks, deep ruts, and uneven tracks.</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="text-black font-black">Off-Road Tyres:</span> All-terrain tyres for better grip and safer towing in remote areas.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter text-black mt-24 mb-8">What Is a Semi Off-Road Caravan?</h2>
                    <p class="mb-8">A semi off-road caravan is designed for travellers who want to explore beyond highways but do not plan extreme off-road adventures. These caravans are ideal for sealed highways, caravan parks, and light gravel roads.</p>
                    <p class="mb-12">They offer more comfort and affordability compared to heavy-duty off-road caravans. They are perfect for travellers who want flexibility—coastal routes, farm tracks, and regional touring—without going deep into the outback.</p>

                    <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-24 mt-16 shadow-2xl rounded-3xl border border-black/5">
                        <table class="w-full text-left bg-[#f9f9f9] border-collapse">
                            <thead>
                                <tr class="bg-black text-white">
                                    <th class="p-6 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest font-black">Feature</th>
                                    <th class="p-6 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest font-black">Off-Road Caravan</th>
                                    <th class="p-6 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest font-black">Semi Off-Road</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody class="text-sm font-medium">
                                <tr class="border-b border-black/5">
                                    <td class="p-6 font-black uppercase">Terrain</td>
                                    <td class="p-6 text-black/60">Extreme terrain</td>
                                    <td class="p-6 text-black/60">Light to moderate</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr class="border-b border-black/5">
                                    <td class="p-6 font-black uppercase">Suspension</td>
                                    <td class="p-6 text-black/60">Independent Heavy-Duty</td>
                                    <td class="p-6 text-black/60">Leaf Spring or Upgraded</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr class="border-b border-black/5">
                                    <td class="p-6 font-black uppercase">Clearance</td>
                                    <td class="p-6 text-black/60">High</td>
                                    <td class="p-6 text-black/60">Moderate</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td class="p-6 font-black uppercase">Towing</td>
                                    <td class="p-6 text-black/60">Heavy (Powerful Vehicle Req.)</td>
                                    <td class="p-6 text-black/60">Lighter (Better Fuel Efficiency)</td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter text-black mb-8">Which One is Right for You?</h2>
                    <p class="mb-8">Choosing between off-road and semi off-road caravans depends on your travel goals. Choose <strong>Off-Road</strong> if you plan remote expeditions, rough tracks, and long expeditions needing maximum durability.</p>
                    <p class="mb-12">Consider <strong>Semi Off-Road</strong> if you mainly travel on highways and sealed roads, prefer lighter towing, and plan trips to coastal towns and regional caravan parks.</p>

                    <div class="mt-24 p-10 md:p-14 bg-black rounded-[3rem] text-white overflow-hidden relative">
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[url('/roverbg.png')] bg-cover"></div>
                        <div class="relative z-10 text-center">
                            <span class="text-[#E50000] text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6 block">Ready to start?</span>
                            <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight mb-10">Explore Smart Touring with Hike RV</h3>
                            <a href="/contact" class="inline-block px-12 py-5 bg-[#E50000] text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[10px] rounded-full hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all duration-500 shadow-xl">Speak to an Advisor</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Related Footer -->
        <footer class="py-20 bg-[#f9f9f9] border-t border-black/5 px-6 md:px-14">
            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-10">
                <a href="/blogs" class="flex items-center gap-3 text-black font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px] group transition-all">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 19.5L8.25 12l7.5-7.5"/></svg>
                    Back to Articles
                </a>
                <div class="flex gap-6">
                    <button class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all"><svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M24 4.557c-.883.392-1.832.656-2.828.775 1.017-.609 1.798-1.574 2.165-2.724-.951.564-2.005.974-3.127 1.195-.897-.957-2.178-1.555-3.594-1.555-3.179 0-5.515 2.966-4.797 6.045-4.091-.205-7.719-2.165-10.148-5.144-1.29 2.213-.669 5.108 1.523 6.574-.806-.026-1.566-.247-2.229-.616-.054 2.281 1.581 4.415 3.949 4.89-.693.188-1.452.232-2.224.084.626 1.956 2.444 3.379 4.6 3.419-2.07 1.623-4.678 2.348-7.29 2.04 2.179 1.397 4.768 2.212 7.548 2.212 9.142 0 14.307-7.721 13.995-14.646.962-.695 1.797-1.562 2.457-2.549z"/></svg></button>
                    <button class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all"><svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 8h-3v4h3v12h5v-12h3.642l.358-4h-4v-1.667c0-.955.192-1.333 1.115-1.333h2.885v-5h-3.808c-3.596 0-5.192 1.583-5.192 4.615v3.385z"/></svg></button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </footer>

    </main>
</Layout>

<style>
    @keyframes fadeUp {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px); }
        to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    .animate-fade-up {
        animation: fadeUp 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
    }
    @keyframes pulseSlow {
        0%, 100% { opacity: 0.1; }
        50% { opacity: 0.3; }
    }
    .animate-pulse-slow {
        animation: pulseSlow 8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
</style>
